OL,3,GNEWSAHuman League gig washed out, but
OL,4,Aothers to go-ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of weekend concerts will go
OL,7,Fahead despite a show by The Human
OL,8,FLeague being cancelled due to flooding.
OL,10,FHitchin Live has said Thursday's show
OL,11,Fwas cancelled because of severe
OL,12,Fweather, including heavy rain and
OL,13,Fthunderstorms.
OL,15,FThe band, best known for Don't You Want
OL,16,FMe, said it was "very sorry about the
OL,17,Fcancellation" and hoped fans already at
OL,18,FHitchin Priory had managed to get home
OL,19,Fsafely.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
